; Deal_2 is the BOX and it is the one nearest the button, deliberately: it is the object
; tests/Run-ButtonsTest.ps1 has its hider take, because a box settles where it is put and a
; sphere rolls, and because the shortest walk from the rack to START is the most reliable
; staging. Nothing in the GAME depends on which of the three is where — SHELF-1 may reorder
; them — but that suite names prop 1002, so a reorder is a suite edit.

[node name="Deal_2" type="Node3D" parent="ObjectRack"]
